Weekly operational reviews provide an opportunity to evaluate trends that may not be visible during daily monitoring.

Weekly review activities include:

* Capacity analysis
* Security review
* Cost evaluation
* Incident trend analysis
* Documentation updates
* Performance optimization
* Governance verification

# Real-Life Example:
For example, administrators may identify steadily increasing storage consumption and plan expansion before application performance is affected.

# Real-Life Use Case:
A real-life use case is operations teams using weekly reviews to prioritize infrastructure improvements.

Regular reviews improve proactive cloud management.
